WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.353 --> 00:00:03.674
TritonAI Harness is UC San Diego's agent workspace.

2
00:00:03.694 --> 00:00:05.762
It doesn't just answer questions.

3
00:00:05.782 --> 00:00:10.356
It does the work, on your files, with you in control.

4
00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:13.587
Your files stay on your computer.

5
00:00:13.607 --> 00:00:16.891
Only what a task needs goes to an approved model,

6
00:00:16.911 --> 00:00:18.212
through the TritonAI Gateway.

7
00:00:20.493 --> 00:00:22.664
Ask it to summarize a workshop survey.

8
00:00:22.684 --> 00:00:23.603
In Supervised mode,

9
00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:25.795
it checks with you before it runs

10
00:00:25.815 --> 00:00:27.673
a command or changes a file.

11
00:00:28.966 --> 00:00:31.863
About two minutes later, the summary is done,

12
00:00:31.883 --> 00:00:33.686
and every step is logged.

13
00:00:35.971 --> 00:00:37.789
It can also work in desktop apps.

14
00:00:37.809 --> 00:00:39.365
It made this chart in Excel,

15
00:00:39.385 --> 00:00:41.204
using the menus the way you would.

16
00:00:43.478 --> 00:00:46.205
It can turn meeting notes into a slide deck,

17
00:00:46.225 --> 00:00:48.342
on the official UC San Diego template.

18
00:00:50.607 --> 00:00:53.989
You can also build small web apps in the campus style,

19
00:00:54.009 --> 00:00:56.153
and try them right in the Harness.

20
00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:59.586
Then connect them to campus automation.

21
00:00:59.606 --> 00:01:03.919
This test sign-up ran through every step and saved a new row.

22
00:01:06.203 --> 00:01:12.136
That's TritonAI Harness: real work, on your files, with you in control.
